{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 09 · DECISION ROOM — reasons, alternatives, consequences",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -1250,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## History is extended, never rewritten\nA superseded decision keeps its row and gains a successor. Deleting an ADR destroys the only record of why a plausible alternative was rejected.\n[[09 - Decision Room/Decision Log.md]]",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -1090,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "```\nDECISION → REASON (and the trade-off accepted) → ALTERNATIVES\n          → RESULT & AFFECTED SYSTEMS\n             ↳ revisit trigger (what would change it)\n```\nThe **revisit trigger** is what makes an ADR useful. “We chose the best option” is not falsifiable.",
      "x": 200,
      "y": -1090,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-001** — ESP32-WROOM-32-class terminal\n`PROVISIONAL`\n↳ revisit after the exact board is identified",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": -880,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-002** — AS608 fingerprint module\n`SUPERSEDED → 013`\n↳ historical procurement choice",
      "x": -320,
      "y": -880,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "t006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-003** — Local-first, one-host prototype\n`PLANNED`\n↳ revisit only if requirements change",
      "x": 480,
      "y": -880,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-004** — Match on sensor; host gets slot only\n`PROVISIONAL`\n↳ revisit after protocol inspection",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": -735,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-005** — FastAPI + SQLite, single local service\n`DECIDED · IMPLEMENTED`\n↳ revisit if workload exceeds single-host",
      "x": -320,
      "y": -735,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-006** — WAL, ordered migrations, FK, synchronous=FULL\n`DECIDED · VERIFIED`\n↳ revisit only on measured evidence",
      "x": 480,
      "y": -735,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-007** — Vanilla HTML/CSS/ES modules, same origin\n`PLANNED`\n↳ revisit if UI scope justifies tooling",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": -590,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-008** — 60-second same-student suppression\n`DECIDED · VERIFIED`\n↳ change only by explicit requirement",
      "x": -320,
      "y": -590,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-009** — Stable UUID + bounded LittleFS replay\n`IMPLEMENTED · NEEDS HARDWARE`\n↳ validate through reboot/power-cut tests",
      "x": 480,
      "y": -590,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t013",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-010** — Device bearer + admin Basic, demo only\n`DECIDED · IMPLEMENTED`\n↳ no TLS, no production suitability",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": -445,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t014",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-011** — Defer AI; read-only aggregates only\n`DEFERRED`\n↳ reconsider after tested MVP + privacy review",
      "x": -320,
      "y": -445,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "t015",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-012** — Migrate to provisional R703\n`SUPERSEDED → 013`\n↳ superseded by the R307S identification",
      "x": 480,
      "y": -445,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "t016",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-013** — Canonical sensor is R307S\n`DECIDED`\n↳ supersedes 002 and 012",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t017",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-014** — Record bench wiring; preserve GPIO32/33\n`IN PROGRESS · unverified`\n↳ do not infer sensor failure",
      "x": -320,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t018",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-015** — Repository root becomes the Obsidian vault\n`DECIDED`\n↳ retire the nested `obsidian/` vault",
      "x": 480,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t019",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-016** — `fingerprint_sensor.h` → deprecation notice\n`DECIDED`\n↳ revisit if a second sensor family appears",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": -155,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t020",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADR-017** — Physical tests gated on measurable prerequisites\n`DECIDED`\n↳ build pass is never test success",
      "x": -320,
      "y": -155,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "g021",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "DECISION FLOW  —  every row ends in something that can be run",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 3400,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t022",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Research finding**\nnR307S family datasheet",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": 10,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#a16207"
    },
    {
      "id": "t023",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **ADR-013**",
      "x": -600,
      "y": 10,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t024",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **implementation**\nnconfig.h 32/33",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 10,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t025",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **test that would verify it**\nnr307s env, HW-02/03/04",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 10,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t026",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Capacity disagreement**\nn1000 vs 300",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": 98,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#a16207"
    },
    {
      "id": "t027",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **defer provisioning**",
      "x": -600,
      "y": 98,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t028",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **implementation**\nnReadSysPara gate",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 98,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t029",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **test that would verify it**\nnHW-05 — NOT EXECUTED",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 98,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t030",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**FR-04 duplicate rule**\nn60-second window",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": 186,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t031",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **ADR-008**",
      "x": -600,
      "y": 186,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t032",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **implementation**\nnmain.py transaction",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 186,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t033",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **test that would verify it**\nntest_api.py — PASS",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 186,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t034",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Offline requirement**\nnsurvive an outage",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": 274,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t035",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **ADR-009**",
      "x": -600,
      "y": 274,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t036",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **implementation**\nnattendance_store.cpp",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 274,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t037",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **test that would verify it**\nnINT-10 — never run",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 274,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t038",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Privacy boundary**\nnno biometric off-sensor",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": 362,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t039",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **ADR-004**",
      "x": -600,
      "y": 362,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t040",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **implementation**\nnschemas.py slot only",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 362,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t041",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ **test that would verify it**\nntest_api.py — PASS",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 362,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t042",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "A decision whose verification is a vibe is not a decision.",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 3350,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t043",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Change procedure** — 1) append a new ADR row  2) mark the old one `SUPERSEDED by ADR-NNN`, never delete it  3) update the canonical doc  4) update the affected task  5) update the canvas edge.",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 3350,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "#475569"
    },
